fixture zone1_10_standing_dash_stops_at_the_gap
doc Control for zone 1 room 10 (tech 10): the natural attempts without the crouch-dash fail. A standing dash and then hops with the stick held toward gap B (32 u tall) stop at its face (x 950, the 44 tall body); the crouched box cannot move in the air either, but a standing one never gets in to start
room zone1/10_crouch_dash_under
spawn 880 960
frames 100
input
  0 R dash
  1..29 R
  # Hops against the face: a jump with the stick held forward.
  30 R jump
  31..49 R
  50 R jump
  51..99 R
end
expect
  at 0 event.dash=1 height=44
  # The dash meets the face of the wall: centre 950 (the face at 960, half the body 10).
  at 5 x=950u hit_wall=1 height=44
  never 0..99 x>950u
  never 0..99 crouch=1
  never 0..99 event.room=1
end
